EditorNode has 2 main methods for showing a generic dialog: `show_accept()` and `show_warning()`. The main differences are that `show_accept()` allows customizing the OK button text, while `show_warning()` allows customizing title and also has a convenient Copy Text button.\r\n\r\nHOWEVER\r\nThe OK customization in `show_accept()` was never actually used xd Every single call just added `TTR(\"OK\")` as the second parameter. Also that parameter was wrongly named.\r\n\r\nThis PR replaces all `show_accept()` calls with `show_warning()` and removes the former completely.\r\n\r\nFor reference, old:\r\n<img width=\"602\" height=\"152\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ae002a1-ea11-477a-a066-5fe46cb8f6c3\" />\r\n\r\nNew:\r\n<img width=\"655\" height=\"128\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25055a50-ea5e-4c6d-bc97-6d1b5cab7b23\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":